      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ、それがゾルダードのためにもなる。\r\n俺たちにしか出来ないことをやろう。",
        "official_en": "Damn straight, I can support Zoldaad in my own way this way.",
        "real_en": "Yeah. It'll be good for Zoldaad, too. Let's do what only we can do."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
