      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ、任せておけって。\r\n俺って頼りにされればされるほど\r\n力を発揮するタイプなんだな、これが。",
        "official_en": "Count on me all you want. I work well when I know my team relies on me.",
        "real_en": "Yeah, leave it to me. The more people rely on me, the better I perform."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
