      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ、任せてくれ。\r\n俺は狙った獲物は逃さねえからな。",
        "official_en": "You got it. I never miss my mark.",
        "real_en": "You got it. Once I've set my sights on a target, I never let it get away."
      },
