        "official_en_sha256": "3c9a7e05b2e79be61b0b4958937ca0dd77ebb23c2d62894263c6fea1da78179b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "これからは俺もお前たちと一緒に旅をする。\r\nパラデイアの六盟傑って奴らを\r\n放っておくわけにはいかねえからな。",
        "official_en": "I’ll tag along on your journey. Can’t let this Sworn Six of Paladia or whatever they call themselves get away with what they’ve been doing.",
        "real_en": "I'll travel with you from now on. We can't just leave those Sworn Six from Paladia alone."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
